==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Derived from {{Gk.}} ''enkephalopátheia'', from ''enkephalós'' meaning "brain" and ''pathós'' meaning "feeling" or "suffering".

===Noun===
{{en-noun|encephalopathies}}

# {{context|pathology|neurology}} Any various condition affecting the brain.

